{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":552667,\"title\":\"The Moment\",\"tagline\":\"In a war that takes place in peoples minds, how do you rebel when your thoughts are monitored?\",\"overview\":\"The very near future. The interface between mind and machine has been perfected. Nano sensors and transmitters find and attach to neurons, this is the Neural Lace. Everyone is Laced. Invisible technology maps each person's neurons and connects them to everyone else. This has led to an internet of minds called THE MOMENT. A perfect distributed network.\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/uLawIFprIeQ5tdWwHPnxrBSuDCH.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/yIZ8pWJymqk5qxhJEY65ndlF3p3.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"year\":2018,\"runtime\":22,\"genres\":[\"Science Fiction\"],\"status\":\"Released\",\"type\":\"movie\",\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"GB\",\"name\":\"United Kingdom\"}],\"budget\":0,\"revenue\":0,\"director\":\"Richard Ramchurn\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":2510651,\"name\":\"Richard Ramchurn\",\"character\":\"Director\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":126339,\"name\":\"Jennifer Claire\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":5013534,\"name\":\"Madison Fijalkowski\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":2546584,\"name\":\"Ali Gadema\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":null},{\"id\":1585647,\"name\":\"Betty Kaplan\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2UFfA2csu3ChmJJEAlFBXnonKYl.jpg\"},{\"id\":4426068,\"name\":\"Lula Mebrahtu\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3EG2PZLSoe0bjz3lFbUcq1WIDuS.jpg\"},{\"id\":208460,\"name\":\"Anton Valensi\",\"character\":\"Unknown\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hU2IY4iXYwibgbZXSk0u8p1VfBF.jpg\"}],\"similar\":[{\"id\":1726,\"title\":\"Iron Man\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/78lPtwv72eTNqFW9COBYI0dWDJa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cKvDv2LpwVEqbdXWoQl4XgGN6le.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2008,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After being held captive in an Afghan cave, billionaire engineer Tony Stark creates a unique weaponized suit of armor to fight evil.\",\"genres\":[\"Action\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1300968,\"title\":\"The Hunger Games: Sunrise on the Reaping\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nzIXSQNgYZwFOMrmv0d0I3ulvkM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aqFZcr2dxSZ2UwWSo1WC6C0rwDf.jpg\",\"rating\":7.8,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Return to the world of Panem 24 years before Katniss Everdeen volunteers in her sister's place, commencing on the morning of the reaping of the 50th Hunger Games, also known as the Second Quarter Quell.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":969681,\"title\":\"Spider-Man: Brand New Day\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/bjiS5ipwxb9JFy3XRRN4OAilSeX.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/subj7knTn4DeS6KS7qI66EQKe9i.jpg\",\"rating\":8.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn't remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1423191,\"title\":\"Resident Evil\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/gAgWJhUSQWCgtKR8170nMkYlBda.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3icyRAqgakNcQn6aDVz9libFmBA.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Medical courier Bryan unwittingly finds himself fighting for survival as one fateful, horrifying night collapses around him in chaos.\",\"genres\":[\"Horror\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1058424,\"title\":\"Hope\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6VY1ZKgpsc8CfGsQcCGiYEgHdH0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/qqHFLg90IUSoTmSMpKOOW5RyqN3.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In the remote South Korean village of Hope Harbor, police chief Bum-seok and officer Sung-ae are called to investigate a mysterious creature wreaking havoc on the community. But all is not as it seems, and perceptions can be misleading. What begins as ignorance plants the seed of disaster, escalating through human conflict into a tragedy of cosmic proportions.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1381071,\"title\":\"Godzilla Minus Zero\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hSmIJluOJmTWvJs4d7kHRxjc8s8.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/oqrYIDH4tvfEzPe1yqT4jzmAWHQ.jpg\",\"rating\":7.7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"War reduced Japan to zero, and Godzilla plunged it into minus. Two years have passed since then, and the country has faced agonizing struggles to achieve recovery and finally reclaim its daily life. Just as humanity managed to cling to a hard-won peace, a new threat strikes, crushing hope in an instant. There is no third time. Everything ends here.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Horror\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":687163,\"title\":\"Project Hail Mary\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iOb2fjXLbpJgyQXe46n1WtGCnaa.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/2I1OFQJ0L9T0dpU6FobKFWV2PxX.jpg\",\"rating\":8.6,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Science teacher Ryland Grace wakes up on a spaceship light years from home with no recollection of who he is or how he got there. As his memory returns, he begins to uncover his mission: solve the riddle of the mysterious substance causing the sun to die out. He must call on his scientific knowledge and unorthodox ideas to save everything on Earth from extinction.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Adventure\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":755898,\"title\":\"War of the Worlds\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yvirUYrva23IudARHn3mMGVxWqM.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iZLqwEwUViJdSkGVjePGhxYzbDb.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Will Radford is a top analyst for Homeland Security who tracks potential threats through a mass surveillance program, until one day an attack by an unknown entity leads him to question whether the government is hiding something from him... and from the rest of the world.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1101383,\"title\":\"The End of Oak Street\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/7DmtuAK5gYGlMFA45Oxkl1bEpIC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/w9AiymbmQGt3jdtsm78HdfKkChy.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2026,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After a mysterious cosmic event rips Oak Street from suburbia and transports their neighborhood to someplace unknown, the Platt family soon discovers that their very survival depends on them sticking together as they navigate their now unrecognizable surroundings.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Mystery\",\"Thriller\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":299534,\"title\":\"Avengers: Endgame\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jtDv3lCnST0fZRvdYFwR5CVwK2x.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7RyHsO4yDXtBv1zUU3mTpHeQ0d5.jpg\",\"rating\":8.2,\"year\":2019,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.\",\"genres\":[\"Adventure\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Action\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645742,\"title\":\"TRIPLE TIMe\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/vsHhhw5KGQ0AmDvo4Wsj5X4cp2b.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/kwlunaENn0TgS0VFfYi9qIMYGvS.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A theoretical physicist discovers his life is in danger when he comes home to find two future versions of himself.\",\"genres\":[\"Sci-Fi\",\"Romance\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":645752,\"title\":\"Tokyo Rain\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kKhwkO12rqNRfwgusDixuw78UZN.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AoAdQv5Ce5iswpAC4s3k5kD004t.jpg\",\"rating\":10,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Heavy rain has been hitting the facades of Tokyo. Masahiro is alone in his office. He calls his wife, who doesn’t seem to be excited about her husband’s overtime. He falls asleep on the computer during his monotonous paperwork. He has a nightmare. When he wakes up, nothing seems the way it used to be.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Sci-Fi\",\"Fantasy\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"TON2OO8Oa_Y\",\"name\":\"The MOMENT Trailer 2018\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}